---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout>
<section class="legal">
  <div class="legal__container">
    <h1 class="legal__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal__muted">Marsh Market</p>
    <p class="legal__muted">Last updated: 20/02/2026</p>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
      <p><strong>Commercial Name:</strong> Marsh Market</p>
      <p><strong>Location:</strong> Madrid, Spain</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Contact:</strong>
        <a href="mailto:hola@marshmarket.es">hola@marshmarket.es</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>2. Legal Framework</h2>
      <p>This Privacy Policy is drafted in accordance with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)</li>
        <li>Ley Orgánica 3/2018</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>3. Personal Data Collected</h2>
      <p>
        At this time, Marsh Market does not actively collect personal data through:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact forms</li>
        <li>Newsletter subscriptions</li>
        <li>User accounts</li>
        <li>Online payments</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        If a user contacts Marsh Market directly via email, the following data
        may be processed:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Information voluntarily included in the message</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>4. Purpose of Processing</h2>
      <p>Personal data received via email is processed exclusively for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Responding to inquiries</li>
        <li>Providing requested information</li>
        <li>Initiating potential professional collaboration</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>5. Legal Basis</h2>
      <p>
        The legal basis for processing is the user’s consent, given voluntarily
        when contacting Marsh Market.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Personal data will be retained only for as long as necessary to manage
        communication and potential business relationships.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>7. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        Marsh Market does not sell, rent, or share personal data with third
        parties, except when legally required.
      </p>
      <p>
        The website is hosted by Hostinger, which may process technical server
        data necessary for website operation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>8. User Rights</h2>
      <p>In accordance with the GDPR, users have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access their personal data</li>
        <li>Request rectification</li>
        <li>Request erasure</li>
        <li>Restrict processing</li>
        <li>Object to processing</li>
        <li>Request data portability</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise these rights, please contact:
        <a href="mailto:hola@marshmarket.es">hola@marshmarket.es</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__section">
      <h2>9. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        Appropriate technical and organizational measures are implemented to
        protect personal data against unauthorized access, alteration, or loss.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>    
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal__container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .legal__section {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .legal__section h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal__muted {
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .legal p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .legal li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal {
      padding: 3rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .legal__section {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>